connect to their matching quiz and isolate `localStorage` locks under `ds_quiz_lock_<quizId>`.\n4. **Hardening & Sync:**\n   - Hardened [index.html](file:///C:/Users/CxAdmin/Desktop/Exploit/index.html) (`320370` bytes) and [teacher.html](file:///C:/Users/CxAdmin/Desktop/Exploit/teacher.html) (`528707` bytes), synced [index.html](file:///C:/Users/CxAdmin/Desktop/Exploit/index.html) to `quizzes/template` (`HTTP 200`, `320370` bytes), and left [QUIZ06 (1) (1).html](file:///C:/Users/CxAdmin/Desktop/Exploit/QUIZ06%20(1)%20(1).html) (`16327` bytes) untouched.\n\n### Verification Results (Post-Final Edit)\n- **[verify_dashboard.cjs](file:///C:/Users/CxAdmin/.gemini/antigravity/brain/8f2bd4b5-d81b-4839-aa40-a5c3a5acaa6a/scratch/obf_tool/verify_dashboard.cjs) (`exit 0`):** Verified default Dashboard landing without `?quiz=`, `:runQuery` `[label,quizOrder,title]` projection, `Rename` (`Quiz 2` -> `Midterm C: Exam?`) & `Add more Quiz` (`Quiz 3`) persistence, `Load Quiz 1` -> `Quiz 1.html`, `Dashboard` back navigation -> `Load Midterm C: Exam?` isolated state -> `Midterm C_ Exam_.html`, DOS reserved word sanitization (`CON` -> `_CON.html`), standalone `Quiz 2` vault lock isolation & `quiz_2` routing, and live Firestore `:runQuery` probe (`verify_probe_q3` cleaned up).\n- **[verify_combined_reset.cjs](file:///C:/Users/CxAdmin/.gemini/antigravity/brain/8f2bd4b5-d81b-4839-aa40-a5c3a5acaa6a/scratch/obf_tool/verify_combined_reset.cjs) (`exit 0`):** Combined `Clear Students` + Reset Lock passed for both `autoRecordQuiz=true` and `false` on live `verify_probe_tmp` (deleted `HTTP 200`).\n- **[verify_auto_record_gate.cjs](file:///C:/Users/CxAdmin/.gemini/antigravity/brain/8f2bd4b5-d81b-4839-aa40-a5c3a5acaa6a/scratch/obf_tool/verify_auto_record_gate.cjs) (`exit 0`):** Passed `autoRecordQuiz` submission gating, Notice rendering, polling control, and `AbortController` checks.\n- **[verify_stealth_mask.cjs](file:///C:/Users/CxAdmin/.gemini/antigravity/brain/8f2bd4b5-d81b-4839-aa40-a5c3a5aca